00:15:26,666 --> 00:15:32,666
Under the Silver Lake is a crime, drama, mystery film
directed by David Robert Mitchell.

3
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:16,000
Young and disenchanted Sam meets a mysterious and beautiful woman
who's swimming in his building's pool one night.

4
00:30:53,333 --> 00:30:59,333
When she suddenly vanishes the next morning, Sam embarks on a surreal quest across Los Angeles to decode the secret
behind her disappearance, leading him into the murkiest depths of mystery, scandal and conspiracy.

