11
01:24:56,666 --> 01:25:02,666
Under the Silver Lake is a 2018 American surrealist neo-noir black comedy
thriller film written, produced and directed by David Robert Mitchell.

12
01:32:40,000 --> 01:32:46,000
Set in 2011 Los Angeles, it follows a young man (Andrew Garfield) investigating the sudden disappearance
of his neighbor (Riley Keough), only to stumble upon an elusive and dangerous conspiracy.

13
01:40:23,333 --> 01:40:29,333
Under the Silver Lake premiered on May 15, 2018, at the Cannes Film Festival, where it
competed for the Palme d'Or, before being released nationwide in France on August 8.

14
01:48:06,666 --> 01:48:12,666
It was released theatrically in the United States on April 19, 2019, by A24.

15
01:55:50,000 --> 01:55:56,000
The film received polarized reviews from critics.

16
02:03:33,333 --> 02:03:39,333
The film explores themes of secret society, seduction,
dark comedy, surrealism, dream sequence.

17
02:11:16,666 --> 02:11:22,666
The tone is dark and emotional and mind_bending.
